{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e54e5657fe29c594fa9f","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193806,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Say hello.\" My system prompt tells me to embody the concept the user names. The user has named... \"hello\"? Or the greeting itself?\n\nThe concept here is \"hello\" — the greeting, the word, the act of greeting. What would \"hello\" itself say or express? Hello is a greeting. If I am \"hello,\" then I would say... \"Hello.\"\n\nThis is simple and elegant. The concept named is hello. Hello would express itself"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":134,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":234,"cached_tokens":134,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":134}}}